GPUI Kit integrations and editor overlays
Vendored gpui-base sources originate from https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit
at 1ccf011620da24d633f7cd6d3c11ca2e97798dcf (Apache-2.0). Sailry consumes handled
completion and code-action menu keys before later bindings can edit the document.
Kit integration packages retain the same source revision and select its GPUI Fast
0.1.3 backend alongside the rebased Base and Component patches. GPUI WebView owns
native composition on macOS and X11. Provenance and upstream licenses remain in
vendor/gpui-kit/, vendor/gpui-base/ and vendor/gpui-component/.
The renderer patches use the published GPUI Fast 0.1.3 family, with package
provenance, archive checksums and upstream licenses in vendor/gpui-renderer/.

